{"id": "arizona-networking-memoir", "category": "Special Projects", "title": "Arizona Networking Memoirs", "subtitle": "Meals and conversations in Arizona about business and life.", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-arizona-networking-memoir.png", "width": 666, "height": 562, "scale": 1, "fit": "contain", "background": "#ffffff", "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-arizona-networking-memoir-212622ad74e4-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-arizona-networking-memoir-212622ad74e4-666.webp 666w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Meals at Mr. Ueda’s home in the desert</h3><p>In Arizona, I met Mr. Hiro Ueda, who had spent 20 years in business liaison work. I never expected to find Japanese food in the desert that tasted even better than in Japan.</p><p>During my time in the desert, I ate more than a few meals at Mr. Ueda’s home and also learned golf. Beyond business knowledge, I found myself reconsidering my outlook on life and the idea of “Do more for other.”</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering-5226cf92898d-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering-5226cf92898d-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A group photograph at Mr. Ueda’s home.\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A group photograph at Mr. Ueda’s home.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal-654f4dfa6d40-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal-654f4dfa6d40-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A meal at Mr. Ueda’s home.\" width=\"2316\" height=\"3088\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A meal at Mr. Ueda’s home.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Meeting Mel over a meal at 臭豆腐大王</h3><p>I joined angel investors from SIC, focused on sustainable impact investing, for a meal at 臭豆腐大王, where I met Mel.</p><p>The gathering brought together people from different walks of life. Around the table, there was business, but also life’s ups and downs and the perspectives that come from experience.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal-7ef8106dc9b5-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal-7ef8106dc9b5-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Sharing a meal with SIC angel investors at 臭豆腐大王.\" width=\"1477\" height=\"1108\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Sharing a meal with SIC angel investors at 臭豆腐大王.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group-c2f773556ddf-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group-c2f773556ddf-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"A group photograph from the gathering with Mel.\" width=\"1290\" height=\"1009\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A group photograph from the gathering with Mel.</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "status": "published", "pending": "Full article coming soon.", "close": "Close"}